// boot.hex - minimal boot image preloaded at the v586 reset vector
// (0x40d00000, mapped to offset 0 in axi_mem128).
//
// This is a $readmemh file: one byte per line, hex, MSB-first ordering is
// handled by the tool (mem[0] = first line). The single instruction is
//   jmp $        ; EB FE   (jump to self -> infinite loop)
// padded with NOPs (90) so a 128-bit fetch beat is fully defined. Loading
// this proves the full fetch path (useq -> biu -> axi_mem128) works: the
// core fetches EB FE and stays at the reset vector instead of falling
// through zero-filled memory.
EB
FE
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
90
